WEBVTT

00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:07.840
This story is one that lightly describes the ordinary daily lives of the three Minami sisters.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:10.450
Please don't expect too much from it.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:12.410
Also, watch in a bright room,

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:16.100
and stay 3 meters away from the TV while watching.

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:04.850
Yo, Chiaki-chan.

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:13.250
I'm back.

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:22.180
Hi Kana-chan, long time no see.

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:27.310
Chiaki!

00:02:28.990 --> 00:02:31.190
Why is this guy here?

00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:33.340
Close the door, you dumbass.

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:36.030
Nothing good happens when he comes!

00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:38.990
I told you not to let him in on your own, didn't I?

00:02:38.990 --> 00:02:40.780
I can't do that, can I?

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:42.800
It seems that he just broke up with his girlfriend.

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:47.390
We should at least give him a meal and make him feel better.

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:50.310
Eh?! He broke up with his girlfriend?!

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:51.540
What a waste!

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:54.460
That girlfriend was too cute for him too!

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:56.200
What an utter waste!

00:02:56.720 --> 00:03:00.080
That's right. We should treat him kindly at a time like this.

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:03.600
Okay! Kindly... right?

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:12.400
He... He looks like he'll crumble if I touch him.

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:16.980
Leave him alone until Haruka-neesama comes back.

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:20.170
It's not something that the two of us can handle.

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:23.960
You'd better not say anything untactful to him.

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:30.860
Just watch over him quietly.

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:34.710
<i>Quietly...</i>

00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:37.130
<i>Watch over him...</i>

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:45.610
I'm back!

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:49.350
Oh my! Oji-san, welcome.

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:51.870
Haruka-chan, long time no see.

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:54.740
Stop calling me Oji-san, will you?

00:03:54.740 --> 00:03:57.410
I'm still in my twenties.

00:03:57.410 --> 00:03:58.940
That's true.

00:03:58.940 --> 00:04:01.530
So, what brings you here today?

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:11.460
The truth is...

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:15.800
And that's how it is...

00:04:18.760 --> 00:04:20.720
Erm...

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:23.310
I'll go make dinner.

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:28.940
I'll help!

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:32.700
Okay Chiaki, I'm leaving the rest to you!

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:33.980
W-Wait!

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:36.060
Don't leave me alone here!

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:14.940
Thanks for the food.

00:05:15.530 --> 00:05:18.870
Haruka-chan really is good at cooking.

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:20.860
Sorry I wasn't able to serve you anything better.

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:23.240
It's good enough, thanks.

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:24.950
I helped too.

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:27.830
That's what was worrying me.

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:29.300
What the heck do you mean?

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:32.110
If you're energetic enough to say anything cynical, go home.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:37.990
Yes, hello.

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:40.050
Reiko-san!

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:41.440
Yes!

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:44.190
Yes! Yes!

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:45.760
Yes!

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:47.930
You want to speak to me one more time?

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:49.580
Now?

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:50.890
Certainly!

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:58.480
You three, thanks!

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:02.190
I'll try my best!

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:08.880
Chiaki, don't ever let him into the house again!

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:26.470
So it didn't work out?

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:27.690
Yeah.

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:30.070
Minami-ke...

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:11.190
What's the matter, Riko-chan?

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:14.720
No, it's nothing.

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:25.070
Keiko-chan, wait!

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:29.590
W-What?

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:33.420
Fujioka-kun and Minami-san are on pretty good terms lately.

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:37.150
Are they dating?

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:41.100
Kana never mentioned anything of that sort.

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:43.100
Oh! That time you came to my house to have fun!

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:46.780
That's right. When I went to your house last time...

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:51.010
<i>Went to her house... to have fun?</i>

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:54.630
Wait!

00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:56.800
Hey! Gosh...

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:57.790
What?

00:07:57.790 --> 00:08:01.840
He just said that he went to her house to have fun.

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:04.340
Going to a friend's house to play shouldn't be a problem...

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:08.710
Going to her house to have fun when they're already junior high students, isn't that dangerous?!

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:11.520
Keiko, are you an elementary or a junior high student?!

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:16.950
<i>She has already dropped all formalities and begun to address me by just my first name...</i>

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:21.810
Regardless of what grade you're in, going to someone's house to play should...

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:24.190
A kindergartner should just keep quiet for now!

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:28.240
<i>Now I'm not even a student anymore!</i>

00:08:31.580 --> 00:08:34.880
It was really delicious... The curry that you made.

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:36.640
<i>Curry?!</i>

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:40.910
W-Wasn't it? I guess I'm not that bad at cooking.

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:42.940
Yup, you're right!

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:45.920
<i>Homemade cooking?</i>

00:08:47.190 --> 00:08:50.850
<i>Huh? Then isn't my cooking awesome?</i>

00:08:50.850 --> 00:08:54.030
<i>As long as it's made by Minami, anything is delicious!</i>

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:56.990
<i>Kindergartner...</i>

00:08:56.990 --> 00:08:59.360
<i>This...</i>

00:09:02.030 --> 00:09:04.410
What on earth is going on?

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:06.460
Why must you grab my skirt?

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:08.960
Going to her house to play and eating her home cooking...

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:12.990
Aren't they already... lovers?!

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:15.540
Chiaki keeps asking me.

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:17.570
"Is Fujioka coming yet?"

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:20.790
Are Chiaki-chan and Haruka-san well?

00:09:25.910 --> 00:09:28.690
<i>He's already openly accepted by her family...</i>

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:51.420
There are rumors that Uesugi Kenshin was actually a woman.

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:54.010
We know from past accounts that Takeda Shingen has travelled...

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:54.030
Restaurant. Calypso...
We know from past accounts that Takeda Shingen has travelled...

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:56.130
Restaurant. Calypso...

00:10:00.850 --> 00:10:07.710
The fact that pi is close to 3.14 is something I cannot accept. Use 3.14159!

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:09.670
Now that I think about it,

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:11.460
As long as I get on good terms with Minami-san,

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:14.160
it means I'll have more chances to talk with Fujioka-kun, right?

00:10:14.600 --> 00:10:17.960
So what do you want me to do?

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:20.080
Help me break the ice!

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:27.320
Erm... This is Riko-chan from the same class.

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:28.710
Nice to meet you!

00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:31.150
Well, I know you.

00:10:34.390 --> 00:10:35.900
Wait a second.

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:37.230
What do you think you're doing?

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:41.000
Let go.

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:43.400
You first.

00:11:11.140 --> 00:11:12.640
Chiaki.

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:13.510
What's up?

00:11:13.510 --> 00:11:15.480
I want to ask you something.

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:17.650
Do you want to eat pudding?

00:11:18.470 --> 00:11:19.860
Not really.

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:23.100
If you want it, just go to the convenience store and buy some.

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:27.020
Pudding is really tasty.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.650
I already have carbonated drink, so I'm fine.

00:11:55.530 --> 00:11:56.630
Shall we...

00:11:56.630 --> 00:11:57.970
Have a duel?

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:04.750
The loser will have to go buy some regardless of how bad the weather becomes.

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:07.940
Understood, but you'll be the one going anyway.

00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:11.210
So? What shall we compete with?

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:13.040
The fighting game as always?

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:14.900
Or perhaps rock, paper, scissors?

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:19.150
Whichever it is, I'll definitely be the winner anyway.

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:20.190
Let's have a match with this!

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:24.280
This is the new game I borrowed from Keiko on my way home today!

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:26.750
Since this is our first time playing it, the match will be fair!

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:32.160
A game adaptation from a drama series?

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:33.670
Is it okay?

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:35.230
It's still in its plastic wrapper.

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:36.450
It's okay, it's okay.

00:12:37.930 --> 00:12:38.710
Sensei!

00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:39.490
Ninomiya-kun!

00:12:39.930 --> 00:12:40.800
Fight!

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:43.150
Take that! Hey!

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:45.840
Sensei! Sensei!

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:46.560
Ninomiya-kun!

00:12:46.560 --> 00:12:48.250
Ninomiya-kun! Ninomiya-kun! Ninomiya-kun!

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:49.170
Ninomiya-kun!

00:12:49.170 --> 00:12:50.140
Ninomiya-kun!!

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:53.110
Alright! I'm the winner!

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:58.580
Ninomiya-kun!

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:04.130
What's with this game?

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:06.590
Isn't this a fighting game?

00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:09.280
Well, let's continue.

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:12.760
Sensei!

00:13:12.760 --> 00:13:13.860
Ninomiya-kun!

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:17.200
Ninomiya-kun!

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:20.930
What are you doing? Play it properly!

00:13:20.930 --> 00:13:22.210
My bad, my bad.

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:24.530
Sensei!

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:25.340
Ninomiya-kun!

00:13:31.690 --> 00:13:32.900
Ninomiya-kun!

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:36.580
Ninomiya-kun!!

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:37.020
Sensei!

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:39.100
Ninomiya-kun! Ninomiya-kun!

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:40.090
Sensei!

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:41.860
Ninomiya-kun! Ninomiya-kun!

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:49.650
Ninomiya-kun!

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:52.200
Sensei!

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:53.800
Ninomiya-kun!

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:54.550
Sensei!

00:13:54.550 --> 00:13:55.360
Ninomiya-kun!

00:13:55.360 --> 00:13:56.110
Sensei!

00:13:56.110 --> 00:13:57.220
Ninomiya-kun!

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:01.400
I'm back.

00:14:01.740 --> 00:14:05.880
I bought pudding, and Chiaki's carbonated water that was running out.

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:07.450
Sensei!

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:08.260
Ninomiya-kun!

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:11.230
Minami-ke!!!

00:14:17.520 --> 00:14:18.860
Ow ow ow ow...

00:14:18.860 --> 00:14:21.470
Are you okay, Atsuko?

00:14:21.470 --> 00:14:22.110
Yeah.

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:27.090
If you really are that good at volleyball, it's natural that you should join the volleyball club, right?

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:29.530
Ermmm... but...

00:14:29.530 --> 00:14:33.870
Haruka has kids at home, so she can't possibly go home late, right?

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:36.710
That's right!

00:14:36.710 --> 00:14:39.340
They're kids who need lots of attention, so I have to go home early.

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:42.680
<i>Kids?</i>

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:47.930
That's Minami Haruka?

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:51.350
Right? She's a talent, isn't she?

00:14:51.670 --> 00:14:53.870
I wanted to get her into the volleyball club,

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:56.450
But I haven't been able to get a satisfactory reply yet.

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:00.880
You can count on me, Hayami.

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:02.130
I, Hosaka...

00:15:03.140 --> 00:15:06.240
Even if it costs me my life, I'll get Minami Haruka into the Volleyball Club!

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:07.660
Yay!

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:12.560
Yeah...

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:15.620
That senior is really sick.

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:17.780
I'm not saying that he's gross.

00:15:17.780 --> 00:15:20.440
A person like him is called a freak.

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:24.050
Maki... I don't think you should be so critical.

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:26.670
Hosaka-senpai is a nice person.

00:15:26.670 --> 00:15:28.670
He's good at taking care of others too...

00:15:29.630 --> 00:15:31.170
Well, perhaps a bit...

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:33.140
Disgusting, right?

00:15:36.470 --> 00:15:39.690
Say... Why are you speaking up for that senior?

00:15:40.270 --> 00:15:41.540
Do you like him?

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:44.610
If so, I'll have to doubt your tastes.

00:15:46.640 --> 00:15:50.370
<i>Eh? Why am I the one being reprimanded?</i>

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:53.280
Maki, can I have a minute with you?

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:03.450
Erm... Hosaka-senpai.

00:16:03.450 --> 00:16:05.260
Were you by any chance listening?

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:07.170
What?

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:12.550
We were talking about how cool Hosaka-senpai from the Volleyball Club was!

00:16:12.550 --> 00:16:14.350
Oh! Is that so?!

00:16:14.350 --> 00:16:19.500
I wasn't wrong about you, Maki! You were inviting Minami Haruka to join even before I asked!

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:20.950
<i>Disgusting...</i>

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:24.190
Inviting her to join? What do you mean?

00:16:24.890 --> 00:16:28.660
You were inviting Minami Haruka to become a manager, weren't you?

00:16:28.660 --> 00:16:30.490
For the Male Volleyball Club.

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:31.500
Am I wrong?

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:34.570
Everything is just as you've said!

00:16:38.630 --> 00:16:41.930
Why are you making Haruka the manager?

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:43.420
That's obvious, isn't it?

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:47.380
I'm going to get Minami Haruka to wipe my sweat for me!

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:58.270
Oh my, Senpai, you're sweating so much.

00:16:58.600 --> 00:17:01.690
If you don't wipe it off soon, you'll catch a cold.

00:17:03.150 --> 00:17:05.970
You don't need to rush. It's still gushing forth...

00:17:05.970 --> 00:17:06.410
Ha-ru-ka.

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:06.820
Ha-ru-ka.

00:17:06.820 --> 00:17:07.610
Ha-ru-ka.

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:19.720
He's sick!

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:24.040
I have to do something to protect Haruka from this freak!

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:27.370
I got it!

00:17:27.370 --> 00:17:29.200
Senpai! Senpai!

00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:30.300
Hmm, what?

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:35.260
Senpai, I heard Haruka's busy raising children, so she can't join any clubs.

00:17:35.980 --> 00:17:37.430
Raising children?

00:17:37.430 --> 00:17:39.250
Yes, raising children.

00:17:39.860 --> 00:17:41.050
Raising children...

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:56.860
Haruka, food!

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:59.790
Mother, what are we having?

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:13.430
What's wrong?

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:15.510
You're sweating so much.

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:19.670
Minami-ke!

00:18:30.110 --> 00:18:32.750
You over there! Move more swiftly!

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:55.530
What does he want?

00:18:55.960 --> 00:18:58.010
He's calling for us, isn't he?

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:05.940
Erm... Hosaka-senpai?

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:07.600
How many?

00:19:08.890 --> 00:19:11.020
I'm asking you how many.

00:19:11.550 --> 00:19:13.720
Erm... what are you referring to?

00:19:14.310 --> 00:19:17.350
I'm asking you how many kids Minami Haruka has. Isn't that obvious?

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:19.060
E-Erm, kids...

00:19:19.060 --> 00:19:20.070
How many?!

00:19:20.710 --> 00:19:23.290
Two, but those are...

00:19:23.780 --> 00:19:25.400
Oh, two, eh?

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:27.210
I see, I understand now.

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:28.880
What do you understand?

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:31.570
The secret behind Minami Haruka's charm.

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:38.710
Considering the extraordinary charm she exudes, it isn't strange for her to have a kid or two.

00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:41.200
Nope, I should say it's to be expected!

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:46.180
To think that I couldn't understand something as simple as this,

00:19:46.180 --> 00:19:47.850
I still have a long way to go.

00:19:48.470 --> 00:19:50.010
A long way to go...

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:52.010
A long way to go...

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:54.010
Let's go back to our practice.

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:56.740
Do they resemble her?

00:19:57.400 --> 00:19:59.520
Minami Haruka's two kids...

00:19:59.520 --> 00:20:02.090
Are they as lovely as her?

00:20:03.280 --> 00:20:04.530
Do they resemble her?

00:20:05.020 --> 00:20:08.080
I wonder... Well, Haruka did say that they're cute.

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:11.310
Is that so?! Well yeah, her blood flows in them.

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:13.370
It's natural that they're lovely!

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:22.780
This time we're really going back for practice.

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:25.930
No, wait a minute.

00:20:27.220 --> 00:20:31.450
In that case, I'll have to get along with her kids...

00:20:31.450 --> 00:20:33.940
I'm a father of two?!

00:20:44.170 --> 00:20:46.050
Hand over the presents!

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:47.930
Please hand over the presents!

00:20:49.270 --> 00:20:50.840
You should say "welcome back" first, right?

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:52.230
My daughters.

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:54.540
Welcome back, Darling.

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:56.890
I'm back, Haruka.

00:20:56.890 --> 00:20:59.380
You sweated a lot today as well.

00:20:59.380 --> 00:21:02.220
Yes, about three liters.

00:21:02.630 --> 00:21:04.190
Oh my!

00:21:10.890 --> 00:21:13.820
A family is a nice thing to have.

00:21:15.530 --> 00:21:17.530
I promise you, Minami Haruka!

00:21:17.530 --> 00:21:22.510
I'll bring happiness to you and your kids!

00:21:25.350 --> 00:21:28.160
It's about time we really get back to practice.

00:21:28.510 --> 00:21:31.230
That's true! Erm... Hosaka-senpai.

00:21:31.230 --> 00:21:32.880
Don't call me Senpai!

00:21:34.570 --> 00:21:36.710
Then... Then what should we call you?

00:21:37.780 --> 00:21:39.090
Call me Papa.

00:21:40.910 --> 00:21:42.510
Disgusting.

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:49.520
I'm back.

00:21:52.180 --> 00:21:53.690
Haruka, food!

00:21:54.180 --> 00:21:56.570
Haruka-neesama, welcome back!

00:21:59.570 --> 00:22:01.070
I'm back!

00:23:32.230 --> 00:23:33.560
Let's go to the beach, my younger sister!

00:23:33.560 --> 00:23:35.940
Come, prepare my swimsuit as well!

00:23:35.940 --> 00:23:38.270
Talking nonsense with that serious look? You dumbass.

00:23:38.270 --> 00:23:40.720
Well okay, it should be somewhere around here...

00:23:40.720 --> 00:23:42.310
Next time: Let's go to the beach!

00:23:42.310 --> 00:23:42.950
Hey, wait!

00:23:42.950 --> 00:23:46.000
A school-issued swimsuit's difficulty level is too high!
